    "text": "The plane passes through the points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Its equation is <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Image of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;in the plane is<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6